  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;The proposed plans fail to demonstrate that the proposed&amp;nbsp;parking layout is achievable without adversely impacting&amp;nbsp;upon existing highway infrastructure. Furthermore, the overall parking provision is in excess of the maximum parking standards for the development proposal and would therefore be unsustainable, would reduce on-street public&amp;nbsp;parking provision&amp;nbsp;and would also be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3.D.1,&amp;nbsp;D.11 and T6.1 of The London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Plan Local Policies (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
